                gen "Come on, this was a team effort! And, let’s be honest, you *did* fall asleep on the job." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Wide smile, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center (Smirking)
                cho @ cheeks blush "Well, one thing’s for sure... I am *definitely* never napping on the bench again!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center (Annoyed but resigned)
