                cho @ cheeks blush "Yes, and now my uniform is sticking to me like glue! I swear, this job is cursed!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center (Embarrassed and irritated)
