                gen "Just a suggestion." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center (Shrugging)
                cho "(This is awful... First the uniform was too tight, now it’s soaked! And Orion definitely saw everything...)" ("angry", "narrow", "base", "downR")  # Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils down-right (Frustrated, thinking)
                cho "(No, no, no! Stop thinking about that! Focus on work, Cho! You’re a professional!)" ("clench", "narrow", "base", "mid")  # Clenched teeth, narrowed eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center (Determined, trying to compose herself)
                gen "Ms. Chang? You’re mumbling to yourself." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center (Curious, observing)
                cho "I know! I’m just... mentally preparing myself to never let this happen again!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center (Frustrated, determined)
                gen "That’s the spirit. Now, go dry off before you freeze." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center (Playful, but sincere)
                cho "Oh, now you’re concerned about me freezing? After letting me get soaked, dragged into the air, and publicly humiliated?" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center (Sarcastic, indignant)
                gen "Well, you did provide quality entertainment." ("grin", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Wide smile, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center (Amused, provoking)
