                cho "First, the broomsticks kept *flying off* the racks and hovering around the room!" ("angry", "narrow", "base", "R")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils right)
                cho "I had barely grabbed one when—*whoosh*! It zoomed away and knocked me into the equipment chest!" ("clench", "wink", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with clenched teeth (Clenched teeth, wink, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "Sounds like the brooms had a mind of their own." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "*Mind of their own*? It was like they were *laughing* at me!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "I tried grabbing another one, but the bludger came out of *nowhere* and hit the drinks freezer!" ("open", "narrow", "angry", "ahegao")  # Surprise with anger (Open mouth, narrowed eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "The freezer door flew open and *water* sprayed everywhere!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "And *of course*, I was standing right in front of it when it happened!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "down")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils down)
                gen "So, you got soaked?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Soaked? I was *drenched*!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "The water hit me first, and then *splattered* all over the entire team!" ("angry", "narrow", "base", "R")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils right)
                cho "*And* do you know what that did to my skirt?" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                cho @ cheeks blush "It went flying up, exposing *everything* while I tried to keep my balance!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "That must've been quite the sight..." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho @ cheeks blush "Oh, it *was*!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "I was standing there, completely soaked, with my skirt fluttering around, trying to cover myself and keep the gear from falling!" ("angry", "base", "worried", "L")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                cho @ cheeks blush "The whole team saw me *struggling* in front of the water explosion!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "down")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils down)
                cho "And if that wasn't bad enough, I slipped! Right there, in the middle of the mess!" ("clench", "closed", "base", "down")  # Clenched teeth (Clenched teeth, closed eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils down)
                cho "I flailed my arms trying to grab *something*, and guess what I grabbed?" ("open", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Open mouth with worry (Open mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                gen "Please don't say Orion Knight's broom." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Oh, I *wish* it was just his broom! No! I grabbed *his arm*!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "And in the process, I dragged him down into the puddle *with me*!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "ahegao")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "So now *not only* was I soaked and embarrassed, but so was *he*!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "That must have been... an unfortunate turn of events." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Unfortunate?! He just *stared* at me, completely drenched, while the rest of the team burst out laughing!" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                cho "I think I mumbled something like 'Uh, sorry?' but I was too mortified to even think properly!" ("base", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Neutral worry (Neutral mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                gen "I take it he wasn’t pleased?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Oh, he *was* amused, alright. He just smirked and said, 'Guess we’re making a splash before the match, huh?'" ("grin", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Smile with anger (Wide smile, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                gen "At least he took it well." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "That’s not the point! The whole team saw! Now I’m 'The Girl Who Drenched Orion Knight'!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "down")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils down)
                cho "I’ll *never* live this down!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "Well, on the bright side, at least the Quidditch gear is finally organized." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Oh, sure! *That’s* the bright side! Meanwhile, I’m still drying off!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                gen "Every job has its challenges." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "*Ugh!*" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "Your compensation has been updated." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
            else :
                # Team Prank Gone Wild: Cho's Flying Fiasco
                cho "I was helping set up for practice when I noticed something was off..." ("base", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Neutral worry (Neutral mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                cho "The brooms... They felt different, like they were waiting for something." ("angry", "narrow", "base", "R")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils right)
                cho "But I couldn’t put my finger on it. I thought maybe it was just me..." ("clench", "wink", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with clenched teeth (Clenched teeth, wink, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "Different in what way?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Well, they kept wiggling in my hands, like they were eager to fly off!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "And when I finally managed to mount one, it zoomed out from under me!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "down")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils down)
                cho "I thought I was going to crash into the stands!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "Sounds dangerous. Were you okay?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Yeah, but it didn’t stop there!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "I tried to gather up the spare brooms... but every time I picked one up, it slipped out of my hands and started flying by itself!" ("angry", "narrow", "base", "R")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils right)
                cho "And then, the Quaffles started bouncing around, like they were in on the joke!" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                cho "I was running around like a lunatic, trying to catch everything!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "That sounds... strange. Are you sure you weren’t imagining it?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Oh, I’m sure!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "I’m trying to corral a broom, and suddenly... the team starts laughing!" ("angry", "narrow", "angry", "down")  # Anger with narrowed eyes (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils down)
                cho "I realized too late they had enchanted the brooms to mess with me!" ("angry", "base", "worried", "L")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                gen "You’re kidding! The team did that?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "Yes! They were all in on it!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "I was chasing brooms, dodging Quaffles, and getting bumped around by the equipment like some sort of circus act!" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                cho "And just when I thought I had it under control—boom!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho @ cheeks blush "The brooms went crazy, and my skirt went flying up in the wind, exposing everything!" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "mid")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "I bet that was... awkward." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho "You have no idea! The entire team was watching me flailing around, laughing so hard they could barely breathe!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho @ cheeks blush "And there I was, totally exposed, trying to keep my balance and pretend like it was all part of the plan!" ("angry", "narrow", "worried", "L")  # Worried anger (Angry mouth, narrowed eyes, worried eyebrows, pupils left)
                gen "Well, at least it sounds like you were the center of attention!" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho @ cheeks blush "Not the kind of attention I wanted!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                cho "Ugh... I’m never trusting those brooms again." ("angry", "base", "angry", "mid")  # Anger with normal eyes (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, pupils center)
                gen "It was a good lesson in resilience, right?" ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
                cho @ cheeks blush "A terrible lesson in embarrassment!" ("angry", "base", "angry", "ahegao")  # Intense anger (Angry mouth, normal eyes, furrowed eyebrows, ahegao pupils)
                gen "Your compensation has been updated." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")  # Neutral (Neutral mouth, normal eyes, neutral eyebrows, pupils center)
        "-Dismiss her-":
            gen "Great, then that will be all for now." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
            gen "Your sentence reduction are updated.." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
    
    gen "Good job, Ms Chang." ("base", xpos="far_left", ypos="head")
    cho "Thank you, [name_genie_astoria]." ("base", "base", "base", "mid")
    cho "Here's the payment." ("open", "base", "base", "mid")
    nar "You receive {number=payment} gold coins."

    $ game.gold += payment

    call cho_walk(action="leave")

    $ cho.equip(cho_outfit_last)

    $ states.cho.busy = True
    $ current_job = None

    jump main_room_menu

#Send Astoria to work.

